// Formation templates, stated the way Hearts of Iron states a division.
//
//   soft_attack   damage against unarmoured targets - infantry, guns, everything else
//   hard_attack   damage against armour; nearly wasted on infantry, decisive on tanks
//   defense       protection while holding ground
//   breakthrough  protection while attacking - defense's offensive twin
//   armour        above the enemy's piercing, incoming damage is halved
//   piercing      below the enemy's armour, your own damage is halved
//   hardness      how much of this formation counts as armour when it is shot at
//   organisation  the will to keep fighting; men are lost slowly, organisation quickly
//   combat_width  frontage taken in a province, against the 80 a province gives -
//                 four infantry divisions fit, and the fifth waits its turn
//   amphibious    how much of a landing this formation is trained for: 0 is a line
//                 division doing something it was never meant to, 1 is troops for whom
//                 a defended beach is the ordinary way to arrive
//
// A mod may set any single field and inherit the rest.
